### Tera structure

```text
chess-game/
│
├── .gitignore        ← YE FILE ROOT ME
│
├── client/
│   ├── src/
│   ├── package.json
│   └── ...
│
└── server/
    ├── models/
    ├── routes/
    ├── server.js
    ├── package.json
    └── ...
````

⚠️ **Important:** `.env` GitHub par push **mat** karna. Isme `MONGO_URI`, `JWT_SECRET` etc. ho sakte hain.

Phir:

```bash
git add .
git status
```

`git status` mein `.env` **nahi dikhna chahiye**.

Uske baad:

```bash
git commit -m "prepare project for deployment"
git push
```
